    "message": "spicy(variance = \"auto\") as the default: Hartung-Knapp when a condition has at most 5 patients, CR2 otherwise\n\nOn the real-data shuffles (59 folders, two-sided allocation) HK was calibrated and found many more pairs at <= 5\nunits per group, and had a sparse-pair tail at p < 0.001 in larger cohorts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01565yM83d4hBtPbzno6i5Fo\n",
